何度も苦しい思いをした
I've been through pain more times than I can say.

670
01:01:29,596 --> 01:01:33,296
何度も悲しい思いもした
I've felt the sorrow that wouldn't go away.

671
01:01:33,596 --> 01:01:37,396
今日までたくさん歩いてきた
Step by step, I've made it here today,

672
01:01:37,396 --> 01:01:49,896
心の坂道を
up the hill where my feelings lay.

673
01:01:49,896 --> 01:01:53,896
君がいたから強くなれた
Because you were there for me, I found the strength to be.

674
01:01:53,896 --> 01:01:57,496
傷だらけであの坂も歩けた
Even with scars, I climbed that hill with ease.

675
01:01:57,496 --> 01:02:00,896
君がいるから歩いていけるさ
Because you're here with me, I know I'll keep walking free,

676
01:02:00,896 --> 01:02:05,596
涙の足跡残さないで
leaving no tears for the world to see.

677
01:02:05,596 --> 01:02:12,896
君がいたから
Because you were there for me,

678
01:02:13,096 --> 01:02:21,596
君がいるから
because you're here with me.

